    "disclaimer": "손금 결과는 오락과 자기 성찰 목적입니다. 의학적 진단, 치료, 건강 결정을 대신하지 않습니다."
  },
  "en": {
    "faqTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
    "readingTitle": "Read more",
    "introTitle": "Palmistry is not a medical chart; it is a symbolic story drawn across the hand",
    "intro": "Palmistry observes lines such as the life line, heart line, head line, and fate line to reflect temperament, attention, and ways of relating to life. The lines of the hand do not diagnose health. Use the result for self-understanding and light conversation.",
    "conceptTitle": "Major palm lines",
    "concepts": [
      {
        "title": "Life line",
        "body": "The curve around the thumb is read as vitality and life rhythm, not literal lifespan."
      },
      {
        "title": "Heart line",
        "body": "The line beneath the fingers suggests emotional expression and relationship style."
      },
      {
        "title": "Head and fate lines",
        "body": "These lines can symbolize thinking habits and direction, without fixing destiny."
      }
    ],
    "useTitle": "How to use it",
    "useCases": [
      {
        "title": "Compare both hands",
        "body": "Palm traditions often compare the dominant and non-dominant hands for current habits and inherited tendencies."
      },
