      {
        "question": "Can palmistry diagnose health?",
        "answer": "No. Palmistry is not a medical tool. If you have pain, skin changes, or health concerns, consult a medical professional."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does a short life line mean a short life?",
        "answer": "No. Contemporary symbolic readings treat the life line as vitality, rhythm, and energy style rather than lifespan."
      },
      {
        "question": "Do palm lines change?",
        "answer": "The look of the hand can change with use, skin condition, and time. It is better read as a changing story than fixed fate."
      }
